{"page":226,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:38","surah":11,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَصْنَعُ ٱلْفُلْكَ وَكُلَّمَا مَرَّ عَلَيْهِ مَلَأٌ مِّن قَوْمِهِۦ سَخِرُوا۟ مِنْهُ ۚ قَالَ إِن تَسْخَرُوا۟ مِنَّا فَإِنَّا نَسْخَرُ مِنكُمْ كَمَا تَسْخَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So he began to build the Ark, and whenever leaders of his people passed by, they laughed at him. He said, ‘You may scorn us now, but we will come to scorn you:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَصْنَعُ","en_gloss":"And he was constructing","transliteration":"wayaṣnaʿu","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","en_gloss":"the ship","transliteration":"l-ful'ka","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكُلَّمَا","en_gloss":"and every time","transliteration":"wakullamā","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَرَّ","en_gloss":"passed","transliteration":"marra","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"by him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَلَأٌۭ","en_gloss":"(the) chiefs","transliteration":"mala-on","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his people","transliteration":"qawmihi","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَخِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they ridiculed","transliteration":"sakhirū","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنْهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"[of] him","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَسْخَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"you ridicule","transliteration":"taskharū","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنَّا","en_gloss":"us","transliteration":"minnā","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"then we","transliteration":"fa-innā","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"نَسْخَرُ","en_gloss":"can ridicule","transliteration":"naskharu","verse_key":"11:38"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِن